# Windows-side configuration consumed by SKSE plugins under Proton.
#
# skyrim-install-mods copies mods/config/ verbatim into the game directory, so
# these files must reach the game exactly as committed. This repo sets
# core.autocrlf=input, which would rewrite their CRLF endings to LF on commit
# and hand a Windows DLL a file it never shipped. -text disables all conversion.
games/skyrim-special-edition/mods/config/** -text
